Detection transaction client: Prisma tx client typically has no `$transaction`? Actually interactive transaction client does not expose `$transaction` (I think it does not). We can check generated types or use runtime. In Prisma, `Prisma.TransactionClient` omits `$connect`, `$disconnect`, `$on`, `$transaction`, `$use`, `$extends`. So detection works.

Mapping:
```
